@startuml
participant "File Watcher/Importer" as Importer
participant "Metadata Service" as Metadata
participant "Scaler/Transcoder" as Scaler
participant "ML Service" as ML
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
database "Database" as DB

== Додавання нового файлу ==
Importer -> MQTT: Publish "/perceptrail/item/[id]/added" (file ID, URL)
MQTT -> Metadata: Broadcast new file event
MQTT -> Scaler: Broadcast new file event
MQTT -> ML: Broadcast new file event

== Обробка метаданих ==
Metadata -> MQTT: Publish "/perceptrail/item/[id]/metadata/processed" (file ID, metadata)
Metadata -> DB: Store metadata in database

== Обробка скейлера/транскодера ==
Scaler -> MQTT: Publish "/perceptrail/item/[id]/scaling/processed" (file ID, transcoded file)
Scaler -> DB: Store transcoded file data in database

== Обробка ML ==
ML -> MQTT: Publish "/perceptrail/item/[id]/ml/processed" (file ID, ML results)
ML -> DB: Store ML results in database

== Завершення обробки ==
MQTT -> Importer: Notify all processing done for file [id]
Importer -> MQTT: Publish "/perceptrail/item/[id]/delete" when cleanup required
MQTT -> Metadata: Broadcast delete event
MQTT -> Scaler: Broadcast delete event
MQTT -> ML: Broadcast delete event
@enduml
